## 4. 💳 Taxa de Cartão

| Regra | Valor Padrão |
|---|---|
| Taxa cartão 1x | **5%** do subtotal |
| Taxa cartão 2x | **= taxa 1x** (igualados) |

- **Tabela Supabase:** `fast_store_config` (id=1)
- **Campos:** `card_fee_1x`, `card_fee_2x`
- **Onde altera:** Admin → Configurações → Taxa de Cartão ([handleSaveCardFees()](file:///c:/Users/jhona/CascadeProjects/Fastsavorys/assets/js/admin/config.js#482-489) em [config.js](file:///c:/Users/jhona/CascadeProjects/Fastsavorys/assets/js/admin/config.js))
- **Onde é usada:** [checkout.js](file:///c:/Users/jhona/CascadeProjects/Fastsavorys/assets/js/fast/checkout.js) L629 + [fast.html](file:///c:/Users/jhona/CascadeProjects/Fastsavorys/pages/fast.html) L3781

