| Mínimo para **retirada** | R$ 8,00 | `fast_store_config.min_order_pickup` |
| Mínimo retirada **fora horário** | R$ 15,00 | `fast_store_config.min_order_pickup_offhours` |

- **Onde altera:** Admin → Regras em [admin-rules.js](file:///c:/Users/jhona/CascadeProjects/Fastsavorys/assets/js/fast/admin-rules.js) e [admin/rules.js](file:///c:/Users/jhona/CascadeProjects/Fastsavorys/assets/js/admin/rules.js)
